      "en": "He said to them, “Did you receive the Holy Spirit when you believed?” They said to him, “No, we haven’t even heard that there is a Holy Spirit.”",
      "ko": "가로되 너희가 믿을 때에 성령을 받았느냐 가로되 아니라 우리는 성령이 있음도 듣지 못하였노라",
      "source_text_hash": "1f1d25928643bd0cd63eff9cc15adb2321c5cd6b7db05f56c8e6533cfd431b8a",
      "translation_text_hash": "7cafe44ac4fa3a6de5f0fbc77148e499c33dbf050736f402fe1ac70758317671",
