      "en": "Paul said, “John indeed baptized with the baptism of repentance, saying to the people that they should believe in the one who would come after him, that is, in Christ Jesus.”",
      "ko": "바울이 가로되 요한이 회개의 세례를 베풀며 백성에게 말하되 내 뒤에 오시는 이를 믿으라 하였으니 이는 곧 예수라 하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "9573800c1b22622db1730036d252151b11eeccfab526326fa0a0fdad04294b6c",
      "translation_text_hash": "4d3be8e65b6feb1ef0dafbaac72ff2be764a310cc902f5dc51f7f67e21134e06",
