      "en": "When Paul had laid his hands on them, the Holy Spirit came on them and they spoke with other languages and prophesied.",
      "ko": "바울이 그들에게 안수하매 성령이 그들에게 임하시므로 방언도 하고 예언도 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "61e7134bb83f4e19df57b07aa77d3eec5ea803186409283a98af02578da3055c",
