      "en": "so that even handkerchiefs or aprons were carried away from his body to the sick, and the diseases departed from them, and the evil spirits went out.",
      "ko": "심지어 사람들이 바울의 몸에서 손수건이나 앞치마를 가져다가 병든 사람에게 얹으면 그 병이 떠나고 악귀도 나가더라",
      "source_text_hash": "951fc40408dfe6646a560909331b8b9af3da6618b51cc947522c5230c36f5558",
      "translation_text_hash": "8673da83e02a3ae09f5b6e33618bae127f3b88131a9ce31134943c04a4cc98a5",
