      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 34
        }
      ],
      "en": "But when they perceived that he was a Jew, all with one voice for a time of about two hours cried out, “Great is Artemis of the Ephesians!”",
      "ko": "저희는 그가 유대인인줄 알고 다 한 소리로 외쳐 가로되 크다 에베소 사람의 아데미여 하기를 두시 동안이나 하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "b590b74eb91e4215cbf9b98472926524f6a2bed6a54ca4c646680f94f654a9c3",
      "translation_text_hash": "a70fc1ab40f7573aa9e57d7788694bf94e8509ffd74a6f4af7d0ba95ba2722c1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
